    },
    "你的 macOS 版本还不支持这台相机的 RAW，一览改为显示相机存在文件里的 JPEG 预览图。可以照常翻看、放大、打星和删除，只是不能编辑。升级 macOS 后会自动换成完整解码。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your version of macOS doesn’t support RAW files from this camera yet, so Yilan shows the JPEG preview the camera saved inside the file. You can browse, zoom, rate and delete as usual, but not edit. Full decoding takes over automatically once you update macOS."
          }
