    "只保留和看图有关的功能：两种视图、筛选、照片信息、缩放、旋转、视频播放。评星、编辑、复制和移动到文件夹不再出现；已有的星级和文件不受影响，随时可以关掉恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keeps only what you need for viewing: both views, filters, photo info, zoom, rotation and video playback. Ratings, editing, and copying or moving to a folder no longer appear. Your existing ratings and files are not affected, and you can turn this off at any time."
          }
        }
      }
